# MCP Usage

Judge MCP need before calling. If CLI, local files, or official docs suffice, skip MCP and say so.

**Config:** workspace `.cursor/mcp.json`; user-global Cursor `mcp.json`. **Never** embed API keys in JSON — use `${env:VAR_NAME}`.

Before `call_mcp_tool` / `fetch_mcp_resource`: read tool schema under `mcps/<server>/tools/`. On failure, record reason and use a local alternative.

| Task | Consider MCP | Alternative |
|------|----------------|-------------|
| Library / API docs | Context7, Google Developer Knowledge | Official URL + note in `docs/superpowers/specs/` or research doc |
| Git history / PR | GitHub MCP, GitLens | `git log`, `gh`, web UI |
| UI / web check | Playwright MCP, cursor-ide-browser | Manual check, screenshot |
| Large design split | (optional) | `brainstorming` + spec/plan under `docs/superpowers/` |

## Project rules

- Do not copy external API examples into domain; use application ports and infrastructure adapters.
- Git history inference must be cross-checked against current file contents.
